# Expo workspace boundary (hard constraint)

When the active task is for the **CholoBD Expo mobile app** (`choloBD-expo`):

## Do

- Edit only under `CholoBD-Mobile-App/choloBD-expo/**`
- You may **read** frontend (`NextJS-choloBD-frontend`) and backend (`ExpressJS-choloBD-backend`) for API contracts, parity checks, and diagnosis
- If a fix requires frontend or backend changes: **explain why**, propose the change, and **ask the user first** — do not edit those repos until they approve

## Do not

- Modify, create, delete, or commit files outside `choloBD-expo` while working on mobile tasks
- “Just fix” backend routes, frontend APIs, or shared configs without permission
- Assume multi-root workspace access implies permission to change sibling projects

## Example

```text
❌ BAD: Patch Express guideBookingRoutes.ts while debugging mobile 401s
✅ GOOD: Diagnose that GET /api/bookings/guides lacks JWT middleware; propose backend patch; wait for approval
✅ GOOD: Soft-guard mobile hooks so they only call booking APIs when authenticated
```
